.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_MD-MDC2 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_MD-MDC2
.Nd The MDC2 EVP_MD implementation
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for computing MDC2 digests through the
.Sy EVP_MD
API.
.Ss Identity
This implementation is only available with the legacy provider, and is
identified with the name "MDC2".
.Ss Gettable Parameters
This implementation supports the common gettable parameters described in
.Xr EVP_MD-common 7 .
.Ss Settable Context Parameters
This implementation supports the following
.Xr OSSL_PARAM 3
entries, settable for an
.Sy EVP_MD_CTX
with
.Xr EVP_MD_CTX_set_params 3 :
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqpad-type" ( Ns Sy OSSL_DIGEST_PARAM_PAD_TYPE Ns ) <unsigned integer>
Sets the padding type to be used.
Normally the final MDC2 block is padded with zeros.
If the pad type is set to 2 then the final block is padded with 0x80
followed by zeros.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr EVP_MD_CTX_set_params 3 ,
.Xr provider-digest 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-legacy 7
